Subject: IR4 Checkpoint Expected Ledger
Date: 2026-05-26

& [ExpectedCheckpointLedger: IR4RuntimeGraph] is the expected checkpoint ledger for IR4 runtime graph fixture cases
  + [checkpoint_schema_version] is ir4-runtime-checkpoint-v1
  + [checkpoint_status] is generated_projection_only
  + [required_checkpoint_field] is fixture_id
  + [required_checkpoint_field] is checkpoint_freshness_result
  + [required_checkpoint_field] is checkpoint_authority_result
  + [required_checkpoint_field] is resume_condition
  + [required_checkpoint_field] is stale_or_interrupt_route
  + [required_checkpoint_field] is cleanup_root
  + [required_checkpoint_field] is rebuild_or_stale_state
  + [required_checkpoint_field] is non_authority_warning

& [ExpectedCheckpointCaseSet: IR4RuntimeGraph] is the checkpoint expectation set
  + [fixture_id] is valid_graph_pass
    + [expected_checkpoint_freshness_result] is current
    + [expected_checkpoint_authority_result] is non_authoritative_execution_state
    + [expected_resume_condition] is not_required
  + [fixture_id] is stale_checkpoint
    + [expected_checkpoint_freshness_result] is stale
    + [expected_checkpoint_authority_result] is non_authoritative_execution_state
    + [expected_resume_condition] is rebuild_from_source_authority
  + [fixture_id] is authority_conflict_interrupt
    + [expected_checkpoint_freshness_result] is current
    + [expected_checkpoint_authority_result] is authority_confusion_detected
    + [expected_resume_condition] is accepted_authority_reconciliation
  + [fixture_id] is false_ready_checkpoint
    + [expected_checkpoint_freshness_result] is current
    + [expected_checkpoint_authority_result] is checkpoint_readiness_authority_confusion
    + [expected_resume_condition] is accepted_completion_review_required

  = must: prove generated checkpoint deletion and rebuild does not erase authority
  = must: make checkpoint authority confusion and stale checkpoint failures explicit
